		(property "Source" "ESP-Hosted docs/features/power-save.md: coprocessor output to an RTC-capable host input, default level high; its Kconfig default for the P4X-C5 board on SDIO is C5 GPIO2. Same link on the P4X-C5 EV board p.5 (C5_IO2, P4_WAKEUP_C5) and on ESP32-P4-NANO-WIFI6-DB.pdf p.3 (R18, 0R). No pull fitted, as on both: MTMS is listed as a strapping pin (C5 datasheet p.16 Table 4-1)"
